@startuml 25_seq_outage_recovery
title Independently scheduled service outage recovery (FL-19)
participant "Approved external service" as S
participant "Supabase Edge checker" as C
database "Private PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "FastAPI scoped services API" as API
participant "Flutter operator" as UI
S -> S : Stops serving
C -> S : Public-only bounded probe
S --> C : Network failure
C -> DB : Store UNHEALTHY in workspace
UI -> API : GET authorized service checks with JWT
API -> DB : Enforce workspace membership
DB --> API : UNHEALTHY
API --> UI : Service error
S -> S : Service restored
C -> S : Next approved public probe
S --> C : 200 OK
C -> DB : Store HEALTHY in workspace
UI -> API : Authorized refresh
API -> DB : Enforce membership, fetch latest
DB --> API : HEALTHY
API --> UI : Service recovered
@enduml
